===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gmw-pro|*ahtō}}, from {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*ahtōu}}, from {{inh|ang|ine-pro|*oḱtṓw}}.

Cognate with {{cog|goh|ahto}}, {{cog|osx|ahto}}, {{cog|non|átta}}, {{cog|got|𐌰𐌷𐍄𐌰𐌿}}; and, outside the Germanic languages, with {{cog|sa|अष्ट}}, {{cog|grc|ὀκτώ}}, {{cog|la|octo}}, {{cog|sq|tetë}}, {{cog|sga|ocht}}, {{cog|cu|осмь}}.

